#   cutils - C utilities: the C library binding, small string, integer and byte helpers
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of QuickJS cutils.h (lines 1-251: min/max, clz/ctz, unaligned access, byte
#       swaps) and cutils.c (lines 32-80: pstrcpy, pstrcat, strstart). Also binds the C
#       library's allocator and memory functions once for the whole port, and holds the
#       small helpers every module of the port shares: C strings as `str` views and
